$taskM.limitations=@('Partial9of21 obstacle art groups: seven pillars,farfrog01 and limited wholearch07. Five frogs and seven arch assemblies remain missing.','Whole arch07 visible foot span/gap improved, but hidden rear-plane depth/anchor provisional with30texturepx uncertainty and explicit residual. Separate native left/lintel edits changed canvas and are NOT registered substitutes.','Full-sprite center sorting does not prove partial support/lintel/void occlusion; preserve actual baseline frames then assess improved parts.','Only two support ground shadows supplied; lintel cast-shadow extent and all approach cases remain unverified.','No generated-floor environment sourceClip yet; long walls/near edges remain required work.','New receiver/front registration/policy and normal-scale shadows require actual motion and independent QA.','Native faint alpha residue retained; no trim/threshold/color correction.','No native/core/geometry/PRNG or sorting-method change, no seed offsets/sink/fade, no public delivery token.')
